sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Player
  participant R as Server: reader
  participant M as Server: session loop
  participant G as Stream goroutine (new generation)
  participant DB as Redis
  P->>P: clear append queue, wait for ack of 754000
  P->>R: {"seek_ms": 754000}
  R->>R: credit.reset(754000 + 30 s)
  R->>M: seek 754000
  M->>M: cancel old generation, generation++
  M->>P: {"seek_ack": 754000}
  M->>G: start at 754000
  G->>DB: ZREVRANGEBYSCORE keyframes 754000 -inf LIMIT 0 1
  DB-->>G: 754000-378 (keyframe)
  loop pages of 4, while inside the credit window
    G->>DB: XRANGE from last id COUNT 4
    DB-->>G: fragments
    G->>P: binary fragments (old-generation writes are dropped)
  end
  P->>P: apply seek once buffered media covers 754 s
  P->>R: {"position_ms": 756000, "until_ms": 786000}
  R->>G: credit extended, sending resumes
